<BaseLayout title="Affiliate disclosure" description="How The SMB Desk earns money: affiliate links, display ads and sponsored placements — and how editorial independence is protected.">
  <main class="page">
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
    <p>Some links on this site are affiliate links: if you buy through them, The SMB
      Desk may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.</p>
    <p>Recommendations are decided before monetisation is considered. If a tool is
      recommended, it's because it earned its place in testing — sponsored content is
      always clearly labelled.</p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
